	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["6749EF1FEC7830F8"]
			description: [
				"Ars Nouveau does not hand you spells. You build them: a &eform&f (a bolt, a touch, yourself), then &eeffects&f, then &eaugments&f that make them stronger, wider or longer. Each part is a glyph, written at the Scribe's Table."
				""
				"Casting spends &9mana&f from the same blue bar as Iron's Spells; Ars robes, enchantments and glyphs make that one bar bigger. Machines and rituals run on &dsource&f, which sourcelinks make from the world around them and source jars hold."
				""
				"Ars 'n Spells joins the two systems: the Spell Transcription and Spellbook Binding tablets (at the Enchanting Apparatus) write Ars spells into Iron's spellbooks, and the Mana Infusion and Mana Well rituals refill the shared bar."
				""
				"The Worn Notebook is the whole manual. Its spell book is the only one you need to start."
			]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			id: "1DEB8DE1652F0E11"
			rewards: [
